{
    "word": "holographic",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "6d490bfd-cd62-31dd-9cfb-425ab3029af3",
                "word": "holographic",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "93463a43-6729-3462-a658-af91ff0a4dc5",
                        "entry_id": "6d490bfd-cd62-31dd-9cfb-425ab3029af3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In the form of a hologram or holograph."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a830847b-fe76-4c29-b2eb-f2557aa77a88",
                                "sense_id": "93463a43-6729-3462-a658-af91ff0a4dc5",
                                "text": "Abba meanwhile, all of whom are still alive, will outsource their touring to holographic versions of themselves in 2019. “It’s perfect. We can be on stage while I’m home walking the dogs,” the band’s Benny Andersson said."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c72f4b4b-ff58-3bb2-916f-2ad0227a5e15",
                        "entry_id": "6d490bfd-cd62-31dd-9cfb-425ab3029af3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Handwritten by a single writer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7593a5f-8a15-4b5e-8fe9-dbe1ee6badd5",
                                "sense_id": "c72f4b4b-ff58-3bb2-916f-2ad0227a5e15",
                                "text": "a holographic will or testament"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5dcf471d-a8a2-487e-ba2e-da1e4ab21757",
                                "sense_id": "c72f4b4b-ff58-3bb2-916f-2ad0227a5e15",
                                "text": "[…] although the will is holographic, and a holographic instrument cannot be admitted to probate where testator told the subscribing witnesses that it was not his will, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3280ca2-a8e2-407e-a2da-bd13ee0adb97",
                                "sense_id": "c72f4b4b-ff58-3bb2-916f-2ad0227a5e15",
                                "text": "Upon the face of the will, which is holographic, and of considerable length, there is not the slightest evidence of derangement […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "83bcdae0-db9c-4dfc-97fe-8d7035aa6ae1",
                        "source_entry_id": "6d490bfd-cd62-31dd-9cfb-425ab3029af3",
                        "source_sense_description": "in the form of a hologram or holograph",
                        "target_lang_word": "holografisch",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "holografisch",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5035dcaf-553d-33dc-9dd8-f3214955b343",
                                        "entry_id": "f6f133e6-84a1-37cf-bebe-26044e6749f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "betrekking hebbend op of gemaakt met holografie"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0414bf7-12df-450f-9025-72f2b8b9abc1",
                                                "sense_id": "5035dcaf-553d-33dc-9dd8-f3214955b343",
                                                "text": "Op het toneel zagen we de holografische projectie van een bewegende maar al lang overleden popster."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "04fdcadb-5ca9-46d3-b811-77899ec8674f",
                        "source_entry_id": "6d490bfd-cd62-31dd-9cfb-425ab3029af3",
                        "source_sense_description": "in the form of a hologram or holograph",
                        "target_lang_word": "holographique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "holographique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d6d0e5b-815e-3e9e-8abc-4142a73d71b0",
                                        "entry_id": "4994e0e5-99e5-3781-8360-982d7bf6874a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif à l’holographie, qui concerne l’holographie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75d84e0f-68a9-4a9f-8abc-cba99211b98b",
                                                "sense_id": "3d6d0e5b-815e-3e9e-8abc-4142a73d71b0",
                                                "text": "Bluffant: ceux-ci apparaissent sous forme d’images holographiques, comme s’ils se trouvaient entre ses mains."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0937377e-d66c-4c2d-aeab-61ed23b19cab",
                        "source_entry_id": "6d490bfd-cd62-31dd-9cfb-425ab3029af3",
                        "source_sense_description": "in the form of a hologram or holograph",
                        "target_lang_word": "holographisch",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "holographisch",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ff7735c-f740-3836-b53a-fa90218c3d65",
                                        "entry_id": "ff4f22ec-0193-3c6c-a293-4a830523aef8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "auf Hologramme oder die Holografie bezogen; mithilfe der Holografie"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3797e7b8-dc69-468f-9ae1-a2a9f77dea4a",
                                                "sense_id": "6ff7735c-f740-3836-b53a-fa90218c3d65",
                                                "text": "„Um ein Objekt holographisch aufzuzeichnen wird es mit kohärentem Licht be- oder durchleuchtet.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbeb24ce-3716-47e8-8634-6041ed5b1e2b",
                                                "sense_id": "6ff7735c-f740-3836-b53a-fa90218c3d65",
                                                "text": "„Die Größe der holographisch darstellbaren Objekte wird von der Intensität der verfügbaren Laserstrahlung bestimmt, da das aus dem Laser austretende Strahlenbündel nur einen Durchmesser von der Größenordnung 1 mm hat.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "884032f6-4b06-3044-a8e8-95a4a8fc598f",
                                        "entry_id": "ff4f22ec-0193-3c6c-a293-4a830523aef8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "mit der Hand geschrieben"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Rechtswissenschaften"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79ff1ac5-1e1e-4639-b355-706305ada354",
                                                "sense_id": "884032f6-4b06-3044-a8e8-95a4a8fc598f",
                                                "text": "„[…] beim Testament ist dagegen erforderlich, daß der Erblasser die gesamte Urkunde mit eigener Hand schreibt und unterschreibt (sog. holographische Schriftform, vgl. ä 2247 Abs. 1 BGB). Ein mit Schreibmaschine angefertigtes und nur unterschriebenes Testament […] ist also unwirksam […].“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "776e1e21-8430-4dcb-996f-7f3be5ace2c7",
